[]},{"date":"2016-05-31T08:44:00-07:00","id":904192,"title":"","content":"Caveat: I support all things WWI that weren't written by, like, Chris Clark or Niall Ferguson. So carry on.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:12px\">-</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3093-hm8453a","name":"hm8453a","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3093_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"636"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-31T11:16:23-07:00","id":904305,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>hm8453a</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/wraith-the-oblivion/904173-ww1-anniversary-coming-up?p=904192#post904192\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Caveat: I support all things WWI that weren't written by, like, Chris Clark or Niall Ferguson. So carry on.</div> </div> </div> </div>What is the nature of your disagreement with Clark and Ferguson? (He asked out of legitimate academic curiosity.)<br /> <br /> EDIT: More specifically interested in reactions to Clark. Ferguson is practically his own straw man.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2507,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2507-caitiff-primogen","user":"Caitiff Primogen","date":". 05-31-2016, 02:26 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2507-caitiff-primogen","name":"Caitiff Primogen","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2507_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1351"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-31T12:42:45-07:00","id":904367,"title":"","content":"Yeah the start of the war was the summer of 1914 so the 100th Anniversary was the summer before last. In fact the utterly awesome and amazing Valiant Hearts: the Great War came out to coincide with the 100th Anniversary of the war's start. The anniversary of its end won't be until November 11 2018, two and after years from now.<br /> <br /> Anyone looking for awesome things on WWI, check out the Youtube channel, <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCUcyEsEjhPEDf69RRVhRh4A\" target=\"_blank\">The Great War</a>. Every week they cover what happened that week a hundred years ago in the war as well as special videos like Q&amp;A's, bios on individuals, etc.<br /> <br /> There's also Extra Credit's <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLhyKYa0YJ_5Aq7g4bil7bnGi0A8gTsawu\" target=\"_blank\">Extra History</a>, which covered the events that lead it up to WWI in their second series. Of course all their other series in Extra History is great too and well worth looking at.<br /> <br /> And of course the previously mentioned Valiant Hearts: the Great War.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=MP8q5F6dFqQ\" data-code=\"MP8q5F6dFqQ\" data-provider=\"youtube\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/MP8q5F6dFqQ/maxresdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div><br /> <br /> Seriously if yourself a favor if you like anything to do with WWI and get this game. While it may be stuck behind UPlay it is more than worth it. Don't watch a Let's Play and spoil yourself. Go and play it.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://youtu.be/_yBS2EZFduI?t=2m13s\" target=\"_blank\">Homo sapiens. What an inventive, invincible species. It's only a few million years since they crawled up out of the mud and learned to walk. Puny, defenceless bipeds. They've survived flood, famine and plague. They've survived cosmic wars and holocausts. And now, here they are, out among the stars, waiting to begin a new life. Ready to outsit eternity. They're indomitable. Indomitable.</a>","edited":{"userid":420,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/420-akatsukileader13","user":"AkatsukiLeader13","date":". 06-01-2016, 05:00 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/420-akatsukileader13","name":"AkatsukiLeader13","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar420_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1637"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-01T07:38:41-07:00","id":904954,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>hm8453a</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/wraith-the-oblivion/904173-ww1-anniversary-coming-up?p=904183#post904183\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The anniversary of what within WWI? Because the hundred year anniversary of the start of WWI was a short while back.<br /> <br /> That being said, I'm always happy for WWI stuff and things, because of how little attention non-historians pay to it. Carry on.</div> </div> </div> </div>It's the anniversary of the war itself. So I'm not sure what tangent you went on.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Onyx Path Kickstarters I back.<br /> W20, MtC, CB20, DtD, MtAs20, BotW20, Wraith 20th.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1442-paladindemo","name":"PaladinDemo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1442_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"622"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-01T07:42:28-07:00","id":904956,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>PaladinDemo</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/wraith-the-oblivion/904173-ww1-anniversary-coming-up?p=904954#post904954\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> It's the anniversary of the war itself. So I'm not sure what tangent you went on.</div> </div> </div> </div>The anniversary of WHAT of the war itself? The start? The finish? The anniversary of the assassination of Franz Ferdinand (which is not the start)? What?<br /> <br /> Stating when wars start and end is inherently a political statement, but even if we go by the conventionally stated dates (late July to mid-November), it's none of those dates. So what are you referencing, and why did you get so offended by my asking for a clarification? A war is an ongoing thing. &quot;Anniversary of the war itself&quot; is unhelpful.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:12px\">-</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3093-hm8453a","name":"hm8453a","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3093_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"636"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-01T07:51:47-07:00","id":904961,"title":"","content":"Common sense usually dictates the start of the war, the actual combat not political shenanigans that happened before hand. Still not satisfied.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/World_War_I\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e6/Bataille_de_Verdun_1916.jpg/1280px-Bataille_de_Verdun_1916.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=index&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/World_War_I\" target=\"_blank\"> World War I - Wikipedia </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/World_War_I\" target=\"_blank\"> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/World_War_I </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> Fill in your own blank here.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Onyx Path Kickstarters I back.<br /> W20, MtC, CB20, DtD, MtAs20, BotW20, Wraith 20th.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1442-paladindemo","name":"PaladinDemo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1442_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"622"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-01T07:55:53-07:00","id":904963,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>PaladinDemo</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/wraith-the-oblivion/904173-ww1-anniversary-coming-up?p=904961#post904961\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Common sense usually dictates the start of the war, the actual combat not political shenanigans that happened before hand. Still not satisfied.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/World_War_I\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e6/Bataille_de_Verdun_1916.jpg/1280px-Bataille_de_Verdun_1916.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=index&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/World_War_I\" target=\"_blank\"> World War I - Wikipedia </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/World_War_I\" target=\"_blank\"> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/World_War_I </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> Fill in your own blank here.</div> </div> </div> </div>Well, combat did not start this month, and I'd say relevant military action started in 1867 =).<br /> <br /> But you're getting offended for no reason, rather than enjoying a conversation with other people who are excited to discuss a war so many others ignore. I don't understand it, personally, but I also don't have time for it. I'm going to talk to the other people on this thread who want to talk about the war without needlessly attacking others.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:12px\">-</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3093-hm8453a","name":"hm8453a","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3093_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"636"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-01T07:57:32-07:00","id":904965,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Caitiff Primogen</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/wraith-the-oblivion/904173-ww1-anniversary-coming-up?p=904305#post904305\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> What is the nature of your disagreement with Clark and Ferguson? (He asked out of legitimate academic curiosity.)<br /> <br /> EDIT: More specifically interested in reactions to Clark. Ferguson is practically his own straw man.</div> </div> </div> </div>Apology for Germany is not a good look, and I'd posit that Clark did it to be contrarian and as part of his role in modern Anglo-German relations. But Germany didn't much appreciate it either.<br /> <br /> Slash that's the understatement of the century, it could only have gone worse in Germany if Clark had tried to excuse them for WWII.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:12px\">-</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3093-hm8453a","name"